<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">绑定患者</view>
  <view class="page-subtitle">绑定后即可查看训练安排与记录。</view>

  <view class="notice">
    绑定码由机构管理员提供。还没有绑定码时，请联系管理员获取；管理员会为您生成一次性绑定码。
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <label for="bindingCode" class="bind__label">请输入绑定码</label>
    <input
      id="bindingCode"
      class="bind__input"
      value="{{code}}"
      bindinput="onCodeInput"
      placeholder="绑定码"
      placeholder-style="color:#64748b"
      maxlength="128"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
      aria-label="绑定码"
    />
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice notice--danger" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view>
    <button
      class="btn btn--primary bind__button {{submitting || !code ? 'bind__button--off' : ''}}"
      bindtap="submit"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
      disabled="{{submitting || !code}}"
    >
      {{submitting ? '正在绑定…' : '开始绑定'}}
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">没有绑定码？</view>
    <view class="muted">
      演示数据：演示模式使用预置演示账号登录，进入后展示示例患者与示例训练数据，仅用于产品演示，不是真实患者信息。
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{demoError}}" class="notice notice--danger" aria-role="alert">{{demoError}}</view>
    <button
      class="btn btn--secondary bind__button {{demoLoading || submitting ? 'bind__button--off' : ''}}"
      bindtap="enterDemo"
      loading="{{demoLoading}}"
      disabled="{{demoLoading || submitting}}"
    >
      {{demoLoading ? '正在进入演示…' : '进入演示模式'}}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
